WEBVTT

00:12:28.076 --> 00:12:31.038
one where we are ensuring
our collective futures

00:12:31.038 --> 00:12:33.832
as peoples on this planet.

00:12:36.418 --> 00:12:39.213
There is so much that we can do together.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:41.173
Specifically,

00:12:41.215 --> 00:12:44.760
study the history of Indigenous nations
with traditional territories

00:12:44.802 --> 00:12:46.678
in the places where you live and work.

00:12:47.387 --> 00:12:52.351
Talk with non-Indigenous friends
about Indigenous leadership on the land.

00:12:52.351 --> 00:12:56.230
Create space for Indigenous
voices and uplift them.

00:12:57.439 --> 00:13:01.735
Hold up our communities
and respect our knowledge systems.